on-arrival: ko_leadership_response_2020 = "Programmatic competition with Budka"; young_support += 2; party_unity += 2; ko_relation -= 4; media_capacity += 1; news_headline = "Lewica treats PO renewal as a reason to sharpen its own offer"

We welcome Budka, then answer his renewal pitch with housing, wages and public
services. Our factions enjoy the clear line; KO records us as a competitor.

- @po_handoff_continue: Continue to the campaign ecosystem

