on-arrival: ko_candidate_response_2020 = "Independent campaign against the replacement"; pres_bonus_left += 0.35; party_unity += 2; ko_relation -= 5; media_capacity += 1; news_headline = "Lewica refuses to disappear into KO's relaunch"

We answer KO's reset with our own candidate, programme and cameras. The Left
