@p2050_foundation_2020
# prose-audit: Grade A — Hołownia's organisation emerges from the simulated result in continuous prose, with concrete rivalry on every path.
title: Hołownia turns a breakthrough into Polska 2050
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 32
order: 32
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2020 and month = 8 and p2050_foundation_2020_done = 0
face-image: img/poland/events/pres-candidate-holownia.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.p2050_foundation_2020_done = 1;
Q.p2050_emerged = 1;
Q.p2050_outgoing_role = "independent presidential candidate";
Q.p2050_leader = "Szymon Hołownia";
Q.p2050_incoming_bloc =
    "campaign volunteers, state-capacity experts, Christian democrats and founder loyalists";
const holowniaResult = Math.max(
    0,
    Number(Q.pres_r1_display_holownia) || Number(Q.pres_poll_holownia) || 0
);
const foundationResources = holowniaResult >= 18 ? 7 :
    (holowniaResult >= 10 ? 5 : (holowniaResult >= 5 ? 3 : 2));
const foundationMomentum = holowniaResult >= 18 ? 3 :
    (holowniaResult >= 10 ? 2 : (holowniaResult >= 5 ? 1 : 0.4));
Q.p2050_relation = Math.max(
    Number(Q.p2050_relation) || 0,
    Math.round(20 + Math.min(15, holowniaResult * 0.7))
);
Q.p2050_org_resources = Math.max(
    Number(Q.p2050_org_resources) || 0,
    foundationResources
);
Q.p2050_poll_momentum += foundationMomentum;
Q.p2050_foundation_scale = holowniaResult >= 18
    ? "breakthrough national organisation"
    : (holowniaResult >= 10
        ? "credible national organisation"
        : (holowniaResult >= 5
            ? "modest organisation with a surviving electorate"
            : "fragile campaign remnant"));
Q.news_headline =
    "Szymon Hołownia converts his presidential campaign into Polska 2050";
!}

= August 2020 — A campaign learns to become a party

Hołownia's first-round campaign won **[+ pres_r1_display_holownia +]%** here,
finding voters outside the PiS–KO duel. He now turns volunteers, experts,
Christian democrats and founder loyalists into Polska 2050. The result decides
whether they begin as a [+ p2050_foundation_scale +], but even a fragile remnant
has learned how to organise beyond one candidate.

For us, this is both a rival for younger public-service voters and a possible
partner on institutional reform. Personal rapport with Szymon Hołownia will
not substitute for rules between the organisations we are now building.

- @p2050_institutions
- @p2050_social_competition
- @p2050_local_boundaries

@p2050_institutions
title: Open a written channel on courts, climate and state capacity
subtitle: Build a bounded reform channel; Razem will police its liberal edge.
on-arrival: p2050_foundation_response = "Institutional cooperation channel"; p2050_relation += 6; constitutional_restraint += 2; administrative_reform_pressure += 2; razem_dissent += 2; last_policy_stage = "Inter-party proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Lewica and Polska 2050 party leaderships"; last_policy_implementation = "Not enacted"; news_headline = "Lewica opens a bounded reform channel with Polska 2050"

We put courts, climate and a capable state into writing before goodwill becomes
a substitute for policy. Polska 2050 gains an established partner; Razem
demands that the channel stop at the edge of liberal economics.

- @p2050_2020_continue: Continue to the next August file

@p2050_social_competition
title: Contest Hołownia on work, housing and universal services
subtitle: Draw a material line against a new centre competing for our voters.
on-arrival: p2050_foundation_response = "Social-programme competition"; labor_credibility += 3; young_support += 2; p2050_relation -= 3; party_unity += 1; news_headline = "Lewica draws a material line against the new centre"

We welcome the new party by asking who builds the homes, funds the services and
strengthens the worker. Our camp finds its dividing line; Hołownia learns that
we will not donate the reform electorate without a contest.

- @p2050_2020_continue: Continue to the next August file

@p2050_local_boundaries
title: Propose a no-poaching rule for local organisers and defectors
subtitle: Protect local trust before a national rivalry becomes a defection market.
on-arrival: p2050_foundation_response = "Local no-poaching proposal"; local_network += 2; public_trust += 2; p2050_relation += 1; p2050_coalition_dissent += 2; news_headline = "The two opposition camps write rules for an organisational rivalry"

We offer local organisers a rivalry with rules instead of an auction for
defectors. Voters see restraint; Polska 2050's fastest-growing circles resent a
limit on the very movement that brought them together.

- @p2050_2020_continue: Continue to the next August file

