@tusk_return_2021
# scenario-ledger: KO-01
# prose-audit: Grade A — Tusk's return is framed as a Lewica strategic threat, with political choice copy and faction-aware results.
title: Civic Platform decides whether it needs Tusk's return
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 32
order: 54
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/poland/events/tusk-return-2021.webp
new-page: true
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2021 and month = 7 and tusk_return_2021_done = 0 and election_2027_terminal = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.tusk_return_2021_done = 1;
const po = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record && record.id == "po";
});
const strongEnoughWithoutTusk = Number(Q.ko_poll || 0) >= 26 &&
    Number(po && po.organisation || 0) >= 60;
if (strongEnoughWithoutTusk) {
    Q.ko_outgoing_leader = "Borys Budka";
    Q.ko_leader = Q.trz_inaugurated ? "Borys Budka" : "Rafał Trzaskowski";
    Q.ko_incoming_bloc = Q.trz_inaugurated
        ? "Budka's parliamentary and local-government compact"
        : "Trzaskowski's local-government and social-liberal compact";
    Q.ko_alternative_2021_outcome = "Tusk does not return";
    Q.ko_org_resources += 1;
    Q.ko_poll_momentum += 0.4;
    Q.ko_social_liberal_share += 5;
    Q.news_headline = Q.trz_inaugurated
        ? "A strong KO keeps Budka while President Trzaskowski remains unavailable"
        : "A strong KO selects Trzaskowski and Tusk does not return";
} else {
    Q.ko_outgoing_leader = "Borys Budka";
    Q.ko_leader = "Donald Tusk";
    Q.ko_incoming_bloc =
        "PO's founding apparatus, parliamentary managers and anti-PiS two-bloc strategists";
    Q.ko_alternative_2021_outcome = "Donald Tusk returns";
    Q.ko_org_resources += 3;
    // The founder's return is worth much less to a party that was not on the
    // 2020 second ballot: he can take the leadership, but not the authority to
    // tell the rest of the opposition to stand aside.
    Q.ko_poll_momentum += Q.ko_hegemony_broken ? 0.6 : 1.5;
    Q.ko_coalition_dissent += Q.ko_hegemony_broken ? 8 : 3;
    Q.ko_right_score += 12;
    Q.ko_social_liberal_share -= 12;
    Q.ko_classical_liberal_share += 12;
    Q.news_headline = Q.ko_hegemony_broken
        ? "Tusk returns to a Civic Platform that no longer commands the opposition"
        : "Borys Budka resigns and Donald Tusk returns to lead Civic Platform";
}
!}

= July 2021 — The founder returns to a changed opposition

The party board counts its live polling and regional organisation before it
chooses a leader. [? if ko_alternative_2021_outcome = "Donald Tusk returns":
KO has lost enough ground that **Borys Budka** resigns and founder **Donald
Tusk** returns. His one-bloc strategy strengthens the classical-liberal right
and threatens to squeeze Lewica below visibility.[? if ko_hegemony_broken: It
threatens rather less than it would have. The demand that everybody
concentrate behind KO rests on KO being the party that reaches the second
round, and in June 2020 it was not: **[+ pres_2020_ko_name +]** finished on
**[+ ko_2020_r1_share +]%**. Tusk inherits the machine, the donors and the
name. The argument is not in the inventory.?]?][? if
ko_alternative_2021_outcome = "Tusk does not return": KO remains strong enough
to refuse the rescue script. **[+ ko_leader +]** controls the live party;
Trzaskowski was excluded if he already held the presidency. Tusk remains
outside Polish party leadership.?]

- @tusk_social_terms
- @tusk_democratic_table
- @tusk_autonomy
- @ko_without_tusk_terms
- @ko_without_tusk_autonomy

@tusk_social_terms
title: Offer cooperation only with a written social floor
subtitle: Make wages and services the price of treating Tusk as a future premier.
view-if: ko_alternative_2021_outcome = "Donald Tusk returns"
on-arrival: tusk_return_response = "Cooperation with a written social floor"; ko_relation += 4; labor_credibility += 2; ko_classical_liberal_share += 2; ko_coalition_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Tusk receives Lewica's price for a common government"

We recognise Tusk's claim to govern only after putting wages and services on
paper. KO's coalition managers welcome the opening; its classical liberals ask
why the returning leader should begin by paying Lewica.

- @poland_merger_events.left_revolt: Continue to the merger congress

@tusk_democratic_table
title: Reopen the democratic-opposition table under equal-party rules
subtitle: Coordinate against PiS without accepting a single opposition command.
view-if: ko_alternative_2021_outcome = "Donald Tusk returns"
on-arrival: tusk_return_response = "Equal-party democratic table"; ko_relation += 3; p2050_relation += 3; constitutional_restraint += 2; opposition_list_pressure += 3; news_headline = "Lewica welcomes coordination without accepting Tusk's command"

KO and Polska 2050 return to the table, but every seat reminds Tusk that the
opposition has more than one owner. He responds by making a common list the
next test of whether we are serious.

- @poland_merger_events.left_revolt: Continue to the merger congress

@tusk_autonomy
title: Announce that Lewica will not become Tusk's left faction
subtitle: Rally the Left around autonomy and accept a colder relationship with KO.
view-if: ko_alternative_2021_outcome = "Donald Tusk returns"
on-arrival: tusk_return_response = "Explicit Left autonomy"; party_unity += 4; razem_cooperation += 3; ko_relation -= 6; left_poll_momentum += 0.20; news_headline = "Tusk's return meets an independent Left campaign"

We answer the founder's return with a campaign that he cannot absorb. Razem
and the party wings enjoy the clarity; KO begins treating us as an obstacle to
the two-bloc contest it intends to build.

- @poland_merger_events.left_revolt: Continue to the merger congress

@ko_without_tusk_terms
title: Test the live KO leadership on a written social floor
subtitle: Cooperate with the organisation that survived 2020 without treating one personality as the democratic camp.
view-if: ko_alternative_2021_outcome = "Tusk does not return"
on-arrival: tusk_return_response = "Social terms for KO without Tusk"; ko_relation += 4; labor_credibility += 2; ko_coalition_dissent += 1; news_headline = "Lewica offers the surviving KO leadership a written social floor"

The offer follows the office that exists. It neither drafts Tusk nor makes a
serving president available for party leadership.

- @poland_merger_events.left_revolt: Continue to the merger congress

@ko_without_tusk_autonomy
title: Build Left autonomy against a stronger Civic organisation
subtitle: Accept colder relations rather than rely on KO needing rescue.
view-if: ko_alternative_2021_outcome = "Tusk does not return"
on-arrival: tusk_return_response = "Autonomy against strong KO"; party_unity += 4; local_network += 3; ko_relation -= 5; left_poll_momentum += 0.2; news_headline = "Lewica prepares for a Civic rival that did not collapse"

A strong KO is a different threat from Tusk's return. The response is
organisation rather than personality politics.

- @poland_merger_events.left_revolt: Continue to the merger congress
